- You need any help? - Uh, yeah,

174
00:07:58,020 --> 00:08:00,240
你能拿一下上面的酱汁碗吗
can you, uh, reach that, uh, gravy boat up there?

175
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,710
-没问题  -太好了
- Uh, sure. - Great.

176
00:08:01,710 --> 00:08:03,580
至少你俩还有人能够得着
That makes one of you.

177
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:08,690
我们任务重大  时间却很紧迫
Okay, we have a lot to do and not much time to do it.

178
00:08:08,690 --> 00:08:11,130
伯纳黛特  你负责玉米  肉酱汁和红薯
Bernadette, you're on corn, gravy and yam detail.

179
00:08:11,130 --> 00:08:12,670
艾米  你负责面包卷  蔓越莓
Amy, you're on rolls, cranberries

180
00:08:12,670 --> 00:08:15,400
并且确保不让伯纳黛特靠近棉花糖
and making sure Bernadette stays away from the marshmallows.

181
00:08:16,510 --> 00:08:18,250
没错  我看见你偷吃了
That's right, I see you.

182
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:21,030
如果有问题要问
Okay, if you have any questions,

183
00:08:21,030 --> 00:08:22,830
我就在这里  专心地给烤肉刷油
I'll be over here basting my ass off.

184
00:08:22,830 --> 00:08:24,900
集中注意力是关键
Focus is key.

185
00:08:24,900 --> 00:08:28,220
你们知道佩妮和扎克三年前就结婚了吗
Did you guys know Penny married Zack three years ago?

186
00:08:28,220 --> 00:08:29,970
-什么  -啥
- What? - Wha...?

187
00:08:35,450 --> 00:08:37,070
你打过橄榄球吗
You ever play football?

188
00:08:37,070 --> 00:08:38,830
大学时玩过一点
A little in college.

189
00:08:38,830 --> 00:08:40,450
-你呢  -没玩过
- You? - No.

190
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:43,510
不过我曾经作为球  被人在走廊阻截过一次
But I did get tackled in the hallway once.

191
00:08:45,330 --> 00:08:47,420
整个学校欢声雷动啊
The whole school cheered.

192
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:52,740
我找到了你和扎克
Hey, I found the, uh, court papers

193
00:08:52,740 --> 00:08:53,840
需要填写的法庭文件
that you and Zack need to fill out.

194
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,600
-等我回家就打印出来  -行
- I'll print them when we get home. - Fine.

195
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,630
然后我们就可以彻底忘掉这事了
And we can just put this whole thing behind us.

196
00:08:57,630 --> 00:08:59,270
-你有完没完  -怎么了
- Are you done? - What?

197
00:08:59,270 --> 00:09:00,480
我知道  我做错了
Look, I get it, I screwed up.

198
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:02,020
难道今天剩下的时间  你都要提起这件事吗
Is this all we're gonna talk about the rest of the day?

199
00:09:02,020 --> 00:09:03,220
你对我凶什么呀
Why are you mad at me?

200
00:09:03,220 --> 00:09:04,380
明明是你做了蠢事
You're the one that did the stupid thing.

201
00:09:04,380 --> 00:09:05,520
而我只是帮你解决而已
I'm just trying to fix it.

202
00:09:05,970 --> 00:09:07,270
我需要呼吸点新鲜空气
I need some air.

203
00:09:07,270 --> 00:09:09,160
那个...佩妮
Well... Penny.

204
00:09:09,610 --> 00:09:11,330
我虽然完全不了解女人
Now, I don't know the first thing about women,

205
00:09:11,330 --> 00:09:13,420
但我要是你  我就不会跟出去
but I would not follow her.

206
00:09:16,220 --> 00:09:17,900
听瘦高个的话没错
Listen to Stretch.

207
00:09:24,650 --> 00:09:26,100
怎么成了我的错了
How am I the bad guy?

208
00:09:26,100 --> 00:09:28,880
是她乱嫁人  我是受害者好吗
She's the one who married someone else. I'm the victim.

209
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:30,060
扎克才是受害者吧
Sounds like Zack's the victim.

210
00:09:30,060 --> 00:09:31,820
你睡了人家老婆
You're sleeping with his wife.

211
00:09:34,810 --> 00:09:37,690
我的婚姻35年来一直幸福和睦
I've kept my marriage together for 35 years.

212
00:09:37,690 --> 00:09:39,330
我能给点建议吗
Can I weigh in here?

213
00:09:39,330 --> 00:09:40,250
好呀
Sure.

214
00:09:40,250 --> 00:09:42,670
我正在看比赛呢  闭嘴
I'm trying to watch the game. Shut up.

215
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:48,240
怎么会错过第一次进攻呢
How do you not make a first down there?

216
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:50,270
人家用了五个后卫  他们还敢传球
They passed against a nickel defense.

217
00:09:50,270 --> 00:09:52,150
应该采取摆脱拦截才对
They should have run it off-tackle.

218
00:09:54,900 --> 00:09:56,610
你怎么会看球
How the hell do you know that?

219
00:09:56,610 --> 00:09:58,290
我爸爱死橄榄球了
My father loved football.

220
00:09:58,290 --> 00:09:59,590
他总是强迫我一起看
He always made me watch it

221
00:09:59,590 --> 00:10:02,110
不看完不准做作业
before I was allowed to do my homework.

222
00:10:03,260 --> 00:10:05,120
你高兴了吧  我刚打电话给扎克了
Well, you'll be happy to know I just spoke to Zack

223
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,830
他会签那些文件的
and he's willing to sign the court papers.

224
00:10:06,830 --> 00:10:08,180
他马上就过来
He's on his way here now.

225
00:10:08,180 --> 00:10:10,820
-等等  你居然让他来这  -是呀
- Wait, you invited him here? - Yeah.

226
00:10:10,820 --> 00:10:12,730
我准备再次发表建议了
I'm getting ready to weigh in again.

227
00:10:12,730 --> 00:10:13,310
过来
Come on.

228
00:10:15,620 --> 00:10:17,970
你觉得他们现在应该怎么做
What do you think they ought to do now?

229
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:20,210
我会快速斜向往球场内出发  扔球给外接手
I would throw a quick slant to a wideout,

230
00:10:20,210 --> 00:10:22,290
因为防守线卫似乎要向传球员突袭了
given that the defense is showing blitz.

231
00:10:22,290 --> 00:10:23,850
我最喜欢薄饼卷了
Oh, I love a good blitz,

232
00:10:23,850 --> 00:10:26,160
尤其是加酸奶油的那种
especially with sour cream.

233
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:30,450
懂我笑点吗
Get it?

234
00:10:30,450 --> 00:10:32,960
因为这两者音很近啊
'Cause it sounds like "Blintz."

235
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:35,750
刚有人说"薄饼卷"吗
Did someone say "Blintz"?!

236
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:39,770
我不明白你为什么非得今天把他叫来
I just don't understand why you invited him here today.

237
00:10:39,770 --> 00:10:41,490
因为你唠叨个没完
Because you wouldn't shut up about it.

238
00:10:41,490 --> 00:10:42,780
我打给他时  他反正也没事干
When I called him, he had nothing to do,

239
00:10:42,780 --> 00:10:43,770
所以我就想...
so I just thought it would...

240
00:10:43,770 --> 00:10:45,350
两位  我在里面做饭呢
Hey, guys, I'm trying to cook in here.

241
00:10:45,350 --> 00:10:46,560
抱歉  我们会小点声的
Oh, sorry. We'll keep it down.

242
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:47,990
不  大声点
No, no, speak up.

243
00:10:49,610 --> 00:10:50,620
我要用搅拌器了
I'm about to use the blender,

244
00:10:50,620 --> 00:10:52,330
可我一句也不想漏掉
and I don't want to miss anything.

245
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:55,400
你要多准备一人份的食物了
Well, you might have to cook for one more

246
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:56,960
因为她邀请了扎克过来
because she invited Zack.

247
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:58,640
-什么  -哇哦
- What? - Ooh!

248
00:11:00,030 --> 00:11:01,370
我的天
My, my.

249
00:11:01,370 --> 00:11:05,130
故事发展如同我的肉汁  越加复杂[浓厚]了
The plot, like my gravy, thickens.

250
00:11:09,700 --> 00:11:12,110
我不喜欢你妈的卫生间
I don't care for your mother's bathroom.

251
00:11:12,110 --> 00:11:13,930
不管你面朝哪边尿尿
There's not an angle to do one's business

252
00:11:13,930 --> 00:11:16,770
都有一个小丑雕像瞪着你
without a clown figurine staring at you.

253
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,530
所以我才坐着尿
That's why I sit.

254
00:11:19,530 --> 00:11:22,360
没错  所以你才不爷们
Yeah, that's why.

255
00:11:25,510 --> 00:11:27,410
你还记得达拉斯下大雪的
You remember the Thanksgiving game

256
00:11:27,410 --> 00:11:29,400
那次感恩节比赛吗
when it snowed in Dallas?

257
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:30,850
1993年
1993--

258
00:11:30,850 --> 00:11:32,900
里昂·莱特在最后几秒犯了错
Leon Lett blew the game in the final seconds

259
00:11:32,900 --> 00:11:34,940
海豚队取得了胜利
and the Dolphins emerged victorious.

260
00:11:34,940 --> 00:11:37,170
于是我终于能做我的微积分题了
Then I finally got to do my calculus.

261
00:11:38,420 --> 00:11:41,310
我当时气疯了  差点没一枪崩了电视
I was so pissed, I wanted to shoot my TV.

262
00:11:41,310 --> 00:11:42,830
我爸也是
So was my dad.

263
00:11:42,830 --> 00:11:44,510
他真的开了枪
And then he did.

264
00:11:46,550 --> 00:11:47,590
-有人还要啤酒吗  -我要
- Anyone need a beer?-  Yeah.

265
00:11:48,210 --> 00:11:49,610
谢天谢地
Thank God.

266
00:11:51,090 --> 00:11:53,750
你爸爸还住在德克萨斯吗
So, does your dad still live in Texas?

267
00:11:53,750 --> 00:11:56,800
不  我十四岁时他就死了
No. He died when I was 14.

268
00:11:57,560 --> 00:11:59,200
真是太遗憾了
I'm sorry to hear that.

269
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:01,880
本地酒店的老板也很遗憾
So was the man who owned the local liquor store.

270
00:12:03,550 --> 00:12:06,050
他泣不成声  痛哭流涕
He cried and cried.

271
00:12:07,270 --> 00:12:08,310
啤酒来了
Here you go.

272
00:12:08,310 --> 00:12:09,900
谢谢
Oh, thanks.

273
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:13,190
既然你爸在你十四岁就过世了
So, if your dad died when you were 14,

274
00:12:13,190 --> 00:12:16,280
你肯定没机会和他一起喝啤酒吧
you were never old enough to have a beer with the man.

275
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:17,520
是的  先生
No, sir.

276
00:12:17,520 --> 00:12:20,260
我高中毕业时他想跟我喝一罐
He did try to give me one for my high school graduation,

277
00:12:20,260 --> 00:12:23,240
但我才11岁  我妈妈说不行
but I was 11 and my mom said no.

278
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:30,350
那你就跟我喝一罐吧
Well, you're having one with me.

279
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,410
好的
All right.

280
00:12:38,740 --> 00:12:40,260
敬你的父亲
To your dad.

281
00:12:43,950 --> 00:12:47,250
我也从来没和我爸喝过啤酒
I never had a beer with my dad, either.

282
00:12:51,070 --> 00:12:53,500
能别插嘴吗  我们喝得正欢呢
Do you mind? We're having a moment here.

283
00:13:01,470 --> 00:13:03,490
真不敢相信佩妮嫁给了扎克
I can't believe Penny's married to Zack.

284
00:13:03,860 --> 00:13:05,550
不知道她看上他哪一点
Wonder what she saw in that guy.

285
00:13:05,550 --> 00:13:06,300
不知道
I don't know.

286
00:13:06,300 --> 00:13:08,880
他可爱  高大  英俊
He's sweet, he's tall, handsome.

287
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:10,740
他有宽阔的肩膀  浓密的头发
Broad shoulders, good hair.

288
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:13,050
不知道她看上莱纳德哪一点
Wonder what she sees in Leonard.

289
00:13:16,870 --> 00:13:18,180
外面情况如何
How's it going out there?

290
00:13:18,180 --> 00:13:20,110
谢尔顿和你爸把酒言欢
Sheldon and your dad are bonding

291
00:13:20,110 --> 00:13:21,950
完全无视我的存在
and completely ignoring me.

292
00:13:21,950 --> 00:13:23,530
我知道你的感受
I know how you feel.

293
00:13:23,530 --> 00:13:27,140
他买了智能吸尘器后  无视了我一周
Sheldon ignored me for a week when he got that Roomba vacuum.

294
00:13:29,270 --> 00:13:31,320
趁他不注意的时候  我踢了那玩意一脚
I kick it when he's not looking.

295
00:13:33,540 --> 00:13:34,880
他们在做什么
What are they doing?

296
00:13:34,880 --> 00:13:37,570
喝啤酒  看橄榄球比赛
They're drinking beer and watching football.

297
00:13:37,570 --> 00:13:39,050
你就和他们一起呗
So why don't do that with them.

298
00:13:39,050 --> 00:13:40,600
他们不要我
They don't want me.

299
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:41,540
什么意思
What do you mean?

300
00:13:41,540 --> 00:13:45,140
谢尔顿开始诉说他的父亲已经不在人世了
Well, Sheldon started talking about how his dad isn't alive anymore,

301
00:13:45,140 --> 00:13:47,000
在他们碰杯时  我试图告诉他们
and they were toasting, and I tried to tell them about

302
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:49,120
我父亲抛弃我们时  我有多难过
how sad I was when my dad abandoned...

303
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:50,320
扎克到了
Zack's here!

304
00:13:51,190 --> 00:13:52,690
搅拌肉汁
Stir the gravy.

305
00:13:55,900 --> 00:13:57,660
对不起  我真的很想听你有多难过
Sorry. I really want to hear how sad you are.

306
00:13:57,660 --> 00:13:59,500
五到十分钟后  我就会回来了
I'll be back in like five, ten minutes.

307
00:14:04,690 --> 00:14:06,960
抱歉今天过节  她还让你过来
Sorry she made you come over here on a holiday.

308
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,880
没关系  反正我也没安排
It's all right. I didn't have anything going on.

309
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:10,240
而且  佩妮说我们结婚了
Plus, Penny told me we're married,

310
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:12,880
感恩节就是要和家人一起
and Thanksgiving's a time to be with family.

311
00:14:14,530 --> 00:14:15,200
非常好
Yeah, okay, great.

312
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,240
咱们速战速决吧
Can we just get this over with?

313
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:19,330
好  在这里和这里签名
Yeah, uh, you guys have to sign here and here.

314
00:14:19,330 --> 00:14:21,090
星期一  我们会提出无效申请
On Monday, we'll file for the annulment,

315
00:14:21,090 --> 00:14:22,960
这段婚姻就结束了
and this "Marriage" will be over.

316
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:23,340
好了
Okay.

317
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:26,930
我不确定我是否想签这份文件
I don't know if I want to sign it.

318
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,240
你为什么不想签
Why won't you sign it?

319
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:35,110
我只是觉得分手对孩子影响不好
I just think splitting up can be rough on kids.

320
00:14:36,720 --> 00:14:38,050
我们没有孩子
We don't have any kids.

321
00:14:38,050 --> 00:14:39,590
你确定吗  你也是
Are you sure? 'Cause you didn't know

322
00:14:39,590 --> 00:14:41,740
今早才知道我们结婚了
we were married until this morning.

323
00:14:43,970 --> 00:14:45,190
扎克  拜托
Okay, look, Zack, come on.

324
00:14:45,190 --> 00:14:47,290
我们都知道那场婚礼不是真的
You know neither of us thought this was real.

325
00:14:47,290 --> 00:14:49,740
主婚人是山寨猫王
I mean, we were married by an Elvis impersonator.

326
00:14:49,740 --> 00:14:51,450
当然是山寨的了
Of course it was an impersonator.

327
00:14:51,450 --> 00:14:53,790
真的猫王我们请不起好吧
We could never afford a real Elvis.

328
00:14:57,010 --> 00:14:59,260
你居然嫁给他  不嫁给我
You married him instead of me?

329
00:14:59,260 --> 00:15:01,020
真有眼光
Good call.

330
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:02,670
快签字
Sign the papers.

331
00:15:02,670 --> 00:15:04,050
慢着  算了
Hang on. You know what?

332
00:15:04,050 --> 00:15:05,860
你一整天都是一副欠揍的态度
You have been a jerk about this all day.

333
00:15:05,860 --> 00:15:07,300
你总是这样  每次我犯了错
You always do this-- whenever I mess up,

334
00:15:07,300 --> 00:15:09,200
你就在旁边数落我  让我感觉更难受
you're right there to make me feel even worse about it.

335
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,050
才不是
That is not true.

336
00:15:10,050 --> 00:15:12,000
我们本可以等到周一  再签文件
Yeah, we could've waited till Monday, signed the papers,

337
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:12,970
这事就算过去了
this all would have been over.

338
00:15:12,970 --> 00:15:14,090
是你把他叫过来的
You're the one who invited him here.

339
00:15:14,090 --> 00:15:15,160
你又来了
Oh, there you go again--

340
00:15:15,160 --> 00:15:17,340
又开始当着我的面数落我的错误
just another mistake you're throwing in my face.

341
00:15:17,340 --> 00:15:19,230
这可不好  兄弟
Not cool, bro.

342
00:15:21,560 --> 00:15:22,410
我开始觉得
I'm starting to think

343
00:15:22,410 --> 00:15:25,070
我不想我老婆跟你这种人约会
you're not the kind of guy I want dating my wife.

344
00:15:28,050 --> 00:15:28,530
好吧
Yeah, well,

345
00:15:28,530 --> 00:15:30,440
她做你老婆的时间不会很久了
she's not gonna be your wife for long.

346
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:32,180
不是吧  你快死了吗
Oh, no. Are you dying?

347
00:15:34,040 --> 00:15:35,890
快了  快签字吧
I'm about to. Sign the paper.

348
00:15:38,140 --> 00:15:40,110
常言说得好  老婆开心
Know what they say: "Happy wife,

349
00:15:40,110 --> 00:15:42,250
日子舒心
happy life."

350
00:15:43,290 --> 00:15:44,420
开吃吧
Let's eat.

351
00:15:48,210 --> 00:15:52,540
二  三  八  四  六
Two, three, eight, four, six.

